(3) The charter of Henry III, who had inspected—

(a) 'Cartam quam Henr' rex avus [sic] noster [i.e. Henry II] fecit Roberto Marmyon proavo Philippi Marmyun';

(b) 'Cartam Henrici regis avunculi nostri quam fecit Roberto'; and confirmed them as the charters, 'H. Regis avi nostri et H. regis avunculi nostri', to Philip Marmion.

